&lt;/h3>&lt;ol>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>安装 fcitx5 中文输入法&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Ubuntu 改键</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2023/10/remaps-keys-in-ubuntu/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Oct 2023 11:24:32 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2023/10/remaps-keys-in-ubuntu/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;ol>
&lt;li>在 Ubuntu Software 中搜索 Gnome Tweaks 并安装。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>点击 &lt;em>Keyboard &amp;amp; Mouse&lt;/em>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>点击 &lt;em>Additional Layout Options&lt;/em>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>在弹出的窗口中，勾选 &lt;em>Ctrl position&lt;/em> 中的 &lt;em>Swap Ctrl and Caps Lock&lt;/em>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;p>&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231017_ubuntu_swap_keys.png" alt="ubuntu_swap_keys.png" srcset="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231017_ubuntu_swap_keys.png?size=small, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231017_ubuntu_swap_keys.png?size=medium 1.5x, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231017_ubuntu_swap_keys.png?size=large 2x" data-title="ubuntu_swap_keys.png" style="--width: 895px;--aspect-ratio: 895 / 650;background: url(/images/loading.min.svg) no-repeat center;" onload="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}this.dataset.lazyloaded='';" onerror="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}"/>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>本文基于 Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 及 Gnome Tweaks 3.34.0 编写。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Code Server Nginx Ssl Error</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2023/10/code-server-nginx-ssl-error-1006/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Oct 2023 11:24:30 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2023/10/code-server-nginx-ssl-error-1006/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">An unexpected error occurred that requires a reload of this page.
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">The workbench failed to connect to the server (Error: WebSocket close with status code 1006)&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>Code server popped up a websocket error when I exposed code-server using a custom domain and a custom port via nginx.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231017_code_server_nginx_error_1006.png" alt="20231017_code_server_nginx_error_1006.png" srcset="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231017_code_server_nginx_error_1006.png?size=small, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231017_code_server_nginx_error_1006.png?size=medium 1.5x, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20231017_code_server_nginx_error_1006.png?size=large 2x" data-title="20231017_code_server_nginx_error_1006.png" style="--width: 1114px;--aspect-ratio: 1114 / 630;background: url(/images/loading.min.svg) no-repeat center;" onload="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}this.dataset.lazyloaded='';" onerror="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}"/>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>How to add samba entry in /etc/fstab</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2023/10/fatab-samba/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Oct 2023 11:24:29 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2023/10/fatab-samba/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;p>Configure Samba On Ubuntu&lt;/p>
&lt;h4 id="1-install-necessary-tools" class="heading-element">&lt;span>1. install necessary tools&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#1-install-necessary-tools" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h4>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">sudo apt install cifs-utils&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h4 id="2-prepare-credentials" class="heading-element">&lt;span>2. prepare credentials&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#2-prepare-credentials" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h4>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">sudo mkdir /mnt/samba
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">sudo vi /root/.smb_credentials&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h4 id="3-put-next-2-lines-into-rootsmb_credentials" class="heading-element">&lt;span>3. put next 2 lines into /root/.smb_credentials&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#3-put-next-2-lines-into-rootsmb_credentials" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h4>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">username=&amp;lt;your user name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">password=&amp;lt;your password&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h4 id="4-change-credential-file-permission-for-security-reason" class="heading-element">&lt;span>4. change credential file permission for security reason&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#4-change-credential-file-permission-for-security-reason" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h4>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">chmod &lt;span class="m">600&lt;/span> /root/.smb_credentials&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h4 id="5-configure-etcfstab" class="heading-element">&lt;span>5. configure /etc/fstab&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#5-configure-etcfstab" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h4>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">sudo vi /etc/fstab&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h4 id="6-put-next-line-into-etcfstab-add-noauto-to-options-if-you-dont-want-to-let-ubuntu-auto-mount-this-path" class="heading-element">&lt;span>6. put next line into /etc/fstab. add &lt;code>noauto&lt;/code> to options if you don&amp;rsquo;t want to let Ubuntu auto mount this path&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#6-put-next-line-into-etcfstab-add-noauto-to-options-if-you-dont-want-to-let-ubuntu-auto-mount-this-path" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h4>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">#&amp;lt;shared path&amp;gt; &amp;lt;mount point&amp;gt; &amp;lt;type&amp;gt; &amp;lt;options&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">//192.168.0.3/share /mnt/samba cifs credentials=/root/.smb_credentials,gid=1000,uid=1000,file_mode=0755,dir_mode=0755 0 0&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h4 id="7-mount-it" class="heading-element">&lt;span>7. mount it&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#7-mount-it" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h4>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">umount /mnt/samba -lv
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">mount /mnt/samba&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>本文基于 Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 编写。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Ubuntu Vnc</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2023/04/ubuntu-vnc/</link><pubDate>Mon, 10 Apr 2023 11:24:31 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2023/04/ubuntu-vnc/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;p>本文基于 Ubuntu 20.04 编写。&lt;/p>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>安装 vncserver 和要使用的桌面管理器 xfce
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">apt install tightvncserver xfce4 xfce4-goodies&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>更改密码
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">vncpasswd&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>配置 vnc 以便客户端连接时使用 xfce 桌面
编辑 ~/.vnc/xstartup，输入以下内容
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="cp">#!/bin/sh
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="cp">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">unset&lt;/span> SESSION_MANAGER
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">unset&lt;/span> DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">startxfce4 &lt;span class="p">&amp;amp;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>执行以下命令
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">chmod +x ~/.vnc/xstartup&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>禁用休眠
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">systemctl mask sleep.target suspend.target hibernate.target hybrid-sleep.target&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>启动服务器
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">vncserver -localhost no -geometry 1920x1080&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;h4 id="参考" class="heading-element">&lt;span>参考&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#%e5%8f%82%e8%80%83" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h4>&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://linuxconfig.org/vnc-server-on-ubuntu-20-04-focal-fossa-linux"target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer">https://linuxconfig.org/vnc-server-on-ubuntu-20-04-focal-fossa-linux&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-fw fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/i>&lt;/a>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>端口转发的一些方法</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2023/02/port-forward/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Feb 2023 11:24:24 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2023/02/port-forward/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;p>在《如何抓包分析 vrrp 报文是否中断》中我们使用了 iptables 进行指定协议的报文日志记录功能，此处新增一个好用的命令。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>我们在开发过程中，可能经常需要经过堡垒机、跳板机等中转一次，才能访问到处于小网中的服务，如数据库。使用以下命令，可以在不借助第三方软件的情况下，完成端口转发，实现直连小网服务。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>vrrp 报文抓包的方法</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2022/02/vrrp-cap/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Feb 2022 11:24:24 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2022/02/vrrp-cap/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;p>keepalived 的主机和备机，会每隔3s通过单播，向对方发送 vrrp 报文，当备机在 &lt;code>3次*每次心跳间隔（keepalived.conf中的adver_int参数）&lt;/code> 都收不到主机的广播，自己将会升主。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>一个数据库主备频繁切换案例</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2022/01/a-case-of-database-switch/</link><pubDate>Thu, 20 Jan 2022 11:24:25 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2022/01/a-case-of-database-switch/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;h2 id="问题现象" class="heading-element">&lt;span>问题现象&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#%e9%97%ae%e9%a2%98%e7%8e%b0%e8%b1%a1" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>某集团某局点分别部署了某数据库的主备实例，业务发现偶尔访问数据库报错。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Blktrace</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2021/04/blktrace/</link><pubDate>Mon, 19 Apr 2021 11:24:25 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2021/04/blktrace/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;p>可以用来定位 I/O 性能问题的工具有很多。常见的有 fio, dd, atop, iotop, iostat, vmstat 等。vmstat 可以提供系统性能的一个概览，一般可以看出来性能问题究竟是不是 I/O 的锅。想要具体查看每个设备的 I/O 情况，如 average request size, reads or writes per second，可以使用 iostat。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>npm 镜像等设置</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2018/10/common-pakage-manager-proxy/</link><pubDate>Sat, 13 Oct 2018 11:24:31 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2018/10/common-pakage-manager-proxy/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;h2 id="中国加速镜像" class="heading-element">&lt;span>中国加速镜像&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e5%8a%a0%e9%80%9f%e9%95%9c%e5%83%8f" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;ol>
&lt;li>npm可能未及时同步&lt;/li>
&lt;li>pip可能未同步官方已经删除的恶意软件包&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;table>
 &lt;thead>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;th>manager&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>useful commands&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>command&lt;/th>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/thead>
 &lt;tbody>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>pnpm&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>pnpm get registry&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>pnpm config set registry &lt;a href="https://registry.npmmirror.com"target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer">https://registry.npmmirror.com&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-fw fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/i>&lt;/a>&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>npm&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>npm get registry&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>npm config set registry &lt;a href="https://registry.npmmirror.com"target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer">https://registry.npmmirror.com&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-fw fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/i>&lt;/a>&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>yarn&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>yarn config get registry&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>yarn config set registry &lt;a href="https://registry.npmmirror.com"target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer">https://registry.npmmirror.com&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-fw fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/i>&lt;/a>&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>pip&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>pip config list&lt;/td>
 &lt;td># for pip install&lt;br>pip config set global.index-url &lt;a href="https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple/"target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer">https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple/&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-fw fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/i>&lt;/a>&lt;br># for pip search&lt;br>pip config set global.index &lt;a href="https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi"target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer">https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-fw fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/i>&lt;/a>&lt;br>pip config set global.trusted-host mirrors.aliyun.com&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;h2 id="代理" class="heading-element">&lt;span>代理&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#%e4%bb%a3%e7%90%86" class="heading-mark">
